# OpenAI-compatible gateway

**Skill:** `ai-copilots/skills/polypus-operator/openai-compat.md` (MUST Read when this rule loads).

## MUST

- Keep the public HTTP surface OpenAI-shaped (`/v1/chat/completions`, `/v1/files`, `/v1/batches`, documented Batch statuses).
- Wrap extension-specific request, response, and poll JSON in `internal/clients/<extension>` or gateway adapters.
- Persist OpenAI resources before acknowledging create; on retrieve, return last-known metadata when upstream refresh is empty or unavailable.
- Point clients at the Polypus gateway (`:1320`), not upstream URLs.

## MUST NOT

- Leak upstream field names on public objects (`queueRequest`, `cf_request_id`, Gemini `generateContent` on the wire).
- Fake capabilities the upstream lacks (Batch cancel stays 501, not `cancelled`).
- Dump full skill procedures in this rule file.
